            <p>You are required to have a Webassign homework account.</p>
            <p>Ensure your UTEP e-mail account is working and that you have consistent access to the internet and a stable web browser. <span data-field="browser_options">{{ browser_options }}</span> are the most supported browsers for both Blackboard and WebAssign.</p>
            <p>You will need to have regular access to a computer or laptop. Your cell phone is not sufficient for doing coursework.</p>
            <p>You will need to have regular access to a computer or laptop. Your cell phone is not sufficient for doing coursework. You will need to download or update the following software:</p>
